[*] AoU layout : cocotb burst_test - INCR / WRAP / FIXED multi-beat read-back.
[*]
[*] Emphasis: BEAT SEQUENCING.  AxLEN/AxSIZE/AxBURST sit directly above the
[*] target bridge's beat counter and its running address (base_q -> addr_q), so
[*] a wrong WRAP wrap-around or a missing FIXED hold is visible as a divergence
[*] between the AXI beat and the memory address on the same cycle.  WLAST/RLAST
[*] and last_beat are grouped together for the end-of-burst check.
[*]
[*] wave-check: env=cocotb
[dumpfile] "dv/cocotb/sim_build/axi_ucie_mem_top.fst"
[timestart] 0
[sst_width] 300
[signals_width] 380
[pane_width] 1240
